#: src/routes/HowToPlay.tsx:3191
msgid "You own one <0>wagon</0>. It hauls cargo around the road network between three trade hexes, pays other people to use their roads, and scores you a point for every load it delivers. This is a replacement rather than a layer: there is <1>no robber</1> in the game and <2>no Longest Road award</2>. Largest Army stays."
